&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Revlon, we create beauty innovations for everyone that inspire confidence and ignite joy every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Breaking beauty boundaries is in our company’s DNA. Since its game-changing launch of the first opaque nail enamel in 1932 (and later, the first long-wear foundation), Revlon has provided consumers with high-quality product innovation, performance, and sophisticated glamour. Elizabeth Arden made waves as a woman-led beauty company in the 1920s. In 1931, Almay became the original hypoallergenic, fragrance-free beauty brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Revlon resiliently continues its legacy as a leading global beauty company. Our diverse portfolio—which consists of some of the world’s most iconic brands and product offerings in color cosmetics, skincare, hair color &amp;amp; care, personal care, and fragrances—is sold around the world through prestige, professional, mass, and direct-to-consumer retail channels. These brands include Revlon, Revlon Professional, Elizabeth Arden, Almay, American Crew, CND, Cutex, Mitchum, Sinful Colors, Creme of Nature, Christina Aguilera, John Varvatos, Juicy Couture, Ed Hardy and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We honor our heritage, embrace change, and applaud diversity. We champion our employees and celebrate our consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Revlon, together, transforming beauty.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is a Hybrid Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Employees are expected to work from our London Head Office in Mornington Crescent, NW1, 3 days per week (Mon, Wed, Thurs) and may work remotely the remaining days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an ambitious and commercially driven Senior National Account Manager to join our UK Mass Sales team. This is an exciting opportunity to manage key grocery accounts, drive profitable growth, and play a pivotal role in delivering our sales strategy across a portfolio of leading beauty and personal care brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be an experienced Account Manager with a strong background in FMCG sales, preferably within the grocery sector, and a proven track record of delivering sales, profit and market share growth through effective customer partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take full ownership of major customer relationships, leading negotiations, developing Joint Business Plans, and working cross-functionally to deliver best-in-class commercial execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand Responsibilities include;&amp;nbsp;Revlon Cosmetics, Mitchum, Cutex, Crème of Nature + More&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver sales, profit and market share targets across designated grocery accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic Joint Business Plans (JBPs) aligned to both customer and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead annual commercial negotiations, including trading terms, promotional plans and investment agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage full customer P&amp;amp;L responsibility, ensuring profitable and sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders across customer organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse sales performance, stockholding, forecasts and market trends to identify opportunities and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver accurate sales, volume and financial forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Marketing, Supply Chain, Finance and Customer Service teams to ensure successful execution of plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and optimise promotional performance and return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage invoice and credit-related activities to maintain account health and commercial compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insights and recommendations to support wider business decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in a National Account Manager or Senior National Account Manager role within FMCG. Minimum 4+ Years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering sales growth and profit targets within a fast-paced FMCG environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent commercial acumen with strong P&amp;amp;L management capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced negotiation and influencing skills, with experience leading annual trading negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing Joint Business Plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to interpret data and translate insights into actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build effective relationships both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent forecasting, planning and organisational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Data Protection Disclosure:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by Revlon Consumer Products LLC (“Controller”), and its operating affiliates.&amp;nbsp;Revlon Consumer Products LLC&#39;s data protection officer is Monica Fahnhorst, who can be contacted at &lt;a ---------- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating, and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation) as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. Accordingly, if you are located outside of the United States, your personal data will be transferred to the United States once you submit it through this site. Greenhouse is certified to the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework, which the European Commission has determined ensures an adequate level of protection – comparable to that of the EU – for personal data transferred from the EU.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller for three (3) years. Under the GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have to right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with an EU supervisory authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;opportunity-equal-opportunity-employer-description&quot; data-automation=&quot;job-pay-transparency-policy-statement&quot; data-bind=&quot;visible: $parent.shouldShowPayTransparencyStatemet, text: PayTransparencyPolicyStatement&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/1328/5059/files/Applicant_Privacy_Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
